The direct Sailfish OS hardware-video architecture in this package was adapted
from RooTheater-SailfishOS:

  https://github.com/RootGPT-YouTube/RooTheater-SailfishOS

RooTheater copyright (C) 2026 RootGPT, licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.
SiliSili's modified implementation keeps its separate DASH audio/libmpv clock,
renders decoded gralloc buffers into the existing application-owned shared
Cover texture, and uses in-place decoder flush for seeking.
